config UNISOC_WCN_SDIO
	tristate "Unisoc Marlin3 WCN over SDIO"
	depends on MMC && OF
	depends on FW_LOADER
	help
	  Shared driver for Unisoc Marlin3 wireless combo chips attached over
	  SDIO. It provides firmware download, packet channels, power
	  management and reset for the Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, FM and GNSS devices.
	  Currently the Marlin3lite (UMW2652) variant is supported.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called unisoc-wcn-sdio.
